{"seq":1,"slug":"observable-state-management","title":"@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/observable-state-management","wordCount":755,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"observable-宏与精准状态追踪\">@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Swift 5.9 引入的 Observation 框架（SE-0395）用 <code>@Observable</code> 宏彻底替代了 <code>ObservableObject</code> + <code>@Published</code> 的广播模型。其核心变化是从「对象级订阅，任意属性变化触发全量重渲染」切换到「属性级追踪，只有 body 中实际读取的属性变化才触发该视图刷新」。这一变化将 SwiftUI 的响应式模型从 Combine 依赖中解耦，使跨平台（Linux、Windows）使用成为可能，同时消除了嵌套 <code>ObservableObject</code> 不自动传播的历史痛点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Old[&quot;旧模型 ObservableObject&quot;]&#10;        A[View 订阅整个对象] --&gt; B[任意 Published 变化]&#10;        B --&gt; C[所有订阅 View 重算 body]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph New[&quot;新模型 Observable&quot;]&#10;        D[View body 执行] --&gt; E[Thread-Local AccessList 记录读取的 KeyPath]&#10;        E --&gt; F[仅被读取属性变化时触发该 View 刷新]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Old[\"旧模型 ObservableObject\"]\n        A[View 订阅整个对象] --&gt; B[任意 Published 变化]\n        B --&gt; C[所有订阅 View 重算 body]\n    end\n    subgraph New[\"新模型 Observable\"]\n        D[View body 执行] --&gt; E[Thread-Local AccessList 记录读取的 KeyPath]\n        E --&gt; F[仅被读取属性变化时触发该 View 刷新]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ObservableObject</th>\n<th>@Observable</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追踪粒度</td>\n<td>对象级（全量广播）</td>\n<td>属性级（精准追踪）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套对象</td>\n<td>需手动 <code>cancellables</code> 转发</td>\n<td>自动穿透追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架依赖</td>\n<td>Combine（Apple-only）</td>\n<td>标准库 Observation（跨平台）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样板代码</td>\n<td><code>@Published</code> 每个属性</td>\n<td>零注解，自动追踪所有存储属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>View 端用法</td>\n<td><code>@StateObject</code> / <code>@ObservedObject</code></td>\n<td><code>@State</code> + 普通属性传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算属性</td>\n<td>不自动追踪</td>\n<td>依赖的存储属性变化即触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"宏展开机制\">宏展开机制</h2><p><code>@Observable</code> 是一个 member macro + conformance macro。编译器将你写的每个存储属性重写为带 <code>get</code>/<code>set</code> 访问器的计算属性，原始存储移入带下划线前缀的后备字段，并插入一个 <code>ObservationRegistrar</code> 实例作为追踪中心。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 你写的代码&#10;@Observable&#10;final class ProfileViewModel {&#10;    var username: String = &quot;simran&quot;&#10;    var followerCount: Int = 0&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译器展开后（简化）&#10;final class ProfileViewModel: Observable {&#10;    @ObservationIgnored private var _username: String = &quot;simran&quot;&#10;    @ObservationIgnored private var _followerCount: Int = 0&#10;&#10;    @ObservationIgnored private let _$observationRegistrar = ObservationRegistrar()&#10;&#10;    var username: String {&#10;        get {&#10;            access(keyPath: \\.username)&#10;            return _username&#10;        }&#10;        set {&#10;            withMutation(keyPath: \\.username) {&#10;                _username = newValue&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    // followerCount 同理...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 你写的代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Observable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> username: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"simran\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> followerCount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译器展开后（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Observable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservationIgnored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _username: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"simran\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservationIgnored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _followerCount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservationIgnored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> _</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$observationRegistrar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ObservationRegistrar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> username: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            access</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">keyPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \\.username)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            withMutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">keyPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \\.username) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                _username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // followerCount 同理...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>access(keyPath:)</code> 在 getter 中被调用时，会检查当前线程的 Thread-Local <code>ObservationTracking._accessList</code>。如果 SwiftUI 正在执行某个 View 的 <code>body</code>，该 AccessList 处于活跃状态，keyPath 被注册进去。当 <code>withMutation</code> 在 setter 中触发时，Registrar 遍历所有注册了该 keyPath 的观察者，发出失效通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-swiftui-view-的集成模式\">与 SwiftUI View 的集成模式</h2><p>迁移到 <code>@Observable</code> 后，View 端的用法显著简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 所有权：View 拥有状态 → @State&#10;struct ProfileScreen: View {&#10;    @State private var viewModel = ProfileViewModel()&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack {&#10;            Text(viewModel.username) // 仅 username 变化时刷新&#10;            FollowerBadge(vm: viewModel)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 子视图：直接接收普通属性，无需包装器&#10;struct FollowerBadge: View {&#10;    var vm: ProfileViewModel&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        Text(&quot;\\(vm.followerCount) followers&quot;) // 仅 followerCount 变化时刷新&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 所有权：View 拥有状态 → @State</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileScreen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewModel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProfileViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(viewModel.username) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仅 username 变化时刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            FollowerBadge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">vm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: viewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子视图：直接接收普通属性，无需包装器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FollowerBadge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vm: ProfileViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(vm.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">followerCount</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> followers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仅 followerCount 变化时刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要双向绑定时使用 <code>@Bindable</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct EditProfileView: View {&#10;    @Bindable var vm: ProfileViewModel&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        TextField(&quot;Username&quot;, text: $vm.username)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EditProfileView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Bindable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vm: ProfileViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        TextField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Username\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: $vm.username)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"observationignored-与选择性追踪\">ObservationIgnored 与选择性追踪</h2><p>并非所有属性都需要触发 UI 更新。用 <code>@ObservationIgnored</code> 标记的属性不会被宏重写，读写不触发追踪：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Observable&#10;class DownloadManager {&#10;    var progress: Double = 0        // 追踪，驱动 ProgressView&#10;    var totalBytes: Int64 = 0       // 追踪&#10;&#10;    @ObservationIgnored&#10;    var internalBuffer: Data = .init() // 不追踪，高频写入不触发刷新&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Observable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DownloadManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> progress: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 追踪，驱动 ProgressView</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalBytes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int64</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ObservationIgnored</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> internalBuffer: Data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不追踪，高频写入不触发刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"environment-注入方式变更\">Environment 注入方式变更</h2><p><code>@EnvironmentObject</code> 被 <code>@Environment</code> 的类型查询取代：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 注入&#10;ContentView()&#10;    .environment(appSettings) // 不再是 .environmentObject&#10;&#10;// 消费&#10;@Environment(AppSettings.self) private var settings\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ContentView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(appSettings) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不再是 .environmentObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AppSettings.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settings</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱与性能考量\">常见陷阱与性能考量</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>结构体不适用</strong>：<code>@Observable</code> 仅适用于引用类型（class）。值类型的状态仍用 <code>@State</code> 持有的 struct。</li>\n<li><strong>数组/集合内的对象</strong>：数组元素如果是 <code>@Observable</code> 类，元素属性变化能被追踪；但数组本身的增删需要触发数组属性的 mutation。</li>\n<li><strong>后台线程修改</strong>：<code>ObservationRegistrar</code> 在 Swift 6 严格并发下要求 <code>@MainActor</code> 隔离或 <code>Sendable</code> 合规，否则编译器报错。</li>\n<li><strong>过度计算属性链</strong>：深层计算属性链虽然能自动追踪，但每次 body 求值都会执行整条链，需要评估计算开销。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>@Observable</code> 用宏在编译期重写属性访问器，通过 Thread-Local AccessList 实现属性级精准追踪</li>\n<li>消除了 <code>@Published</code>、<code>@StateObject</code>、<code>@ObservedObject</code> 的选择困难，统一为 <code>@State</code> + 普通传递</li>\n<li>嵌套对象自动穿透、计算属性自动追踪，减少了手动 Combine 管道的工程开销</li>\n<li>Swift 6 严格并发下需要关注 Actor 隔离与 Sendable 合规</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"tca-composable-architecture\">本章：TCA 组合式架构实战</a> — TCA 如何在 @Observable 之上构建可测试的状态容器</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swiftui-in-depth/data-flow/observation-framework\">SwiftUI 深入 - Observation 框架</a> — Observation 框架的基础原理与 SwiftUI 数据流全景</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/macro-fundamentals\">Swift 语言进阶 - 宏基础</a> — Swift Macro 系统的编译模型与自定义宏开发</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪","id":"observable-宏与精准状态追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"宏展开机制","id":"宏展开机制"},{"level":2,"text":"与 SwiftUI View 的集成模式","id":"与-swiftui-view-的集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"ObservationIgnored 与选择性追踪","id":"observationignored-与选择性追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"Environment 注入方式变更","id":"environment-注入方式变更"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与性能考量","id":"常见陷阱与性能考量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"TCA 组合式架构实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/tca-composable-architecture"}}